{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61001","type":"group","x":-20,"y":-340,"width":2020,"height":320,"color":"3","label":"Schoolvoice Product Context — Mental Model, Personas & Source Links"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61002","type":"link","x":0,"y":-270,"width":380,"height":90,"url":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Pc3ZklC-CE0nURaoT34AqI0Wh_rmZxAv7rhPXetab7o/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.8jlh6gupbvr7"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61003","type":"link","x":0,"y":-160,"width":380,"height":90,"url":"https://xmind.ai/MdJa1HAY?xid=5sBt8BfT"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61004","type":"text","x":420,"y":-270,"width":480,"height":200,"color":"3","text":"## Why Schoolvoice Exists\n\nReplaces **two broken extremes**:\n1. **WhatsApp chaos** -> personal number leaks, zero audit trail, buried files\n2. **Legacy portals** -> monthly-only logins, missed approvals & fees\n\n**Solution**: Combine **Daily Habit** (Stories/Drive/Live) + **One-Tap Action Loops** + **Governed Talk & Analytics**."},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61005","type":"file","file":"Schoolvoice/reference/Master-Document-School-Persona/00 - How Schoolvoice Works (Product Mental Model).md","x":940,"y":-270,"width":500,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61006","type":"text","x":1480,"y":-270,"width":500,"height":220,"color":"5","text":"## 5 Personas & Priorities\n\n- **#1 Parents / Guardians**: Zero-friction UX, PIN approvals, translated chat, timezone VoIP\n- **#1 School Admin**: Pre-send approvals, recall, chat extraction, VoIP quotas, reach reports\n- **#2 Teachers**: Grade/CSV targeting, `#variables`, Merge, own-student Stories, Drive\n- **Dept Teams**: Shared RBAC chat queues (Tuition, SEN, Bus, Counselling)\n- **District / Ministry**: Multi-school hierarchy & compliance"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61007","type":"file","file":"Schoolvoice/CONTEXT.md","x":0,"y":40,"width":420,"height":250,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61008","type":"file","file":"Schoolvoice/discovery-notes.md","x":0,"y":320,"width":420,"height":250,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61009","type":"file","file":"Schoolvoice/reference/Master-Document-School-Persona/_Master Document Hub.md","x":0,"y":600,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f6100a","type":"file","file":"Schoolvoice/reference/Master-Document-School-Persona/01 - Overview & Value Proposition.md","x":0,"y":890,"width":420,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f6100b","type":"file","file":"Schoolvoice/reference/Master-Document-School-Persona/Schoolvoice Modules.base","x":0,"y":1160,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f6100c","type":"group","x":480,"y":40,"width":920,"height":520,"color":"5","label":"Loop 2 (Flagship): Structured Decision Engine — Actionable Messages"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f6100d","type":"file","file":"Schoolvoice/reference/Master-Document-School-Persona/02 - Actionable Messages.md","x":500,"y":100,"width":420,"height":430},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f6100e","type":"text","x":950,"y":100,"width":420,"height":205,"color":"5","text":"### 8 One-Tap Action Types\n1. **Announcement** (`Read`)\n2. **Approval** (`Approve/Reject` + PIN)\n3. **Acknowledge** (`Acknowledge`)\n4. **Reply** (`1-to-many` / `many-to-many`)\n5. **Payment** (`Pay [amount]`)\n6. **Absence / Tardiness** (+ excuse upload)\n7. **Moment** (`View Moment`)\n8. **Emergency Alert** (`Call` · silent bypass)"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f6100f","type":"text","x":950,"y":325,"width":420,"height":205,"color":"5","text":"### Delivery, Scale & Safeguards\n- **Target & Personalize**: Grade/CSV + `#variables` + `Message Merge`\n- **Reliability Net**: Timed **Fallback SMS** (offline) + non-responder **Smart Reminder** bump\n- **Governance**: Approval Inbox, Post-send button toggle, Deadline, **Message Recall**, `Staff CC`"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61010","type":"group","x":480,"y":600,"width":920,"height":410,"color":"4","label":"Loop 3: Two-Way Interaction & Safeguarding — Chat & VoIP"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61011","type":"file","file":"Schoolvoice/reference/Master-Document-School-Persona/03 - Chat & Voice Calls.md","x":500,"y":660,"width":420,"height":320},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61012","type":"text","x":950,"y":660,"width":420,"height":150,"color":"4","text":"### Chat & Department Channels\n- Zero phone # leaks, **AI Moderation**, Translation, Voice Notes\n- Unlimited **RBAC Channels** (private parent threads, shared staff queue)\n- **Authorized Chat Extraction** + logged audit trail"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61013","type":"text","x":950,"y":830,"width":420,"height":150,"color":"4","text":"### In-App Recorded VoIP Calls\n- **1:1 Chat only** (disabled in broadcasts)\n- Mon–Fri 12–5 PM timezone-aware schedule (staff can still call out)\n- Relationship caller ID + **100% recorded** + monthly quota"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61014","type":"group","x":480,"y":1050,"width":920,"height":330,"color":"6","label":"Loop 1 (Retention Engine): Daily Habit & Resources — Drives Daily Opens"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61015","type":"file","file":"Schoolvoice/reference/Master-Document-School-Persona/04 - Stories, Teachers Drive & Live Broadcasting.md","x":500,"y":1110,"width":440,"height":240},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61016","type":"text","x":970,"y":1110,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"### Why Daily Habit Matters\nKeeps parents opening Schoolvoice every day so urgent **Actionable Messages** aren't missed:\n- **Stories**: Private class moments, likes/saves, AI moderation, parent reporting\n- **Teachers Drive**: `Public`/`Private` cloud folders on teacher profile\n- **Schoolvoice Live**: In-app live video Q&As & events"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61017","type":"group","x":1460,"y":40,"width":540,"height":1340,"color":"1","label":"Governance, Reach Analytics & Active PO Backlog"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61018","type":"file","file":"Schoolvoice/reference/Master-Document-School-Persona/05 - Reports, District Management & Admin TBAs.md","x":1490,"y":100,"width":480,"height":320},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f61019","type":"text","x":1490,"y":450,"width":480,"height":190,"color":"2","text":"### Analytics Triad (PDF / CSV Exports)\n- **Message Reports**: Action Status Chart, Read/Delivery Chart, Student Audit History\n- **Installation Report**: Guardians/Staff/Students %, Android vs. iOS versions\n- **Reach Report**: Student = Reached if **`>= 1` guardian is active**"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f6101a","type":"text","x":1490,"y":670,"width":480,"height":180,"color":"2","text":"### District & Ministry Scale\n- `District -> Branches/Operators -> Schools -> Grades/Sections/Groups`\n- Cross-school targeting, recall/delete enforcement & rolled-up reach analytics"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f6101b","type":"text","x":1490,"y":880,"width":480,"height":260,"color":"1","text":"### PO Discovery Backlog & Gaps\n- **9 Admin Modules (`TBA`)**: Contact, Permission, Challenges, Absence, Structure, Profile, Modules, SMS, Logs\n- **Doc Mismatches**: `Rewards & Challenges` (listed at top, no body) vs. `Voice Calls` (full body, omitted at top)\n- **Empty Spec Items**: `Message delete` (#16), `Parent feedback attachment`, `Stories Views`"},
		{"id":"c1b2c3d4e5f6101c","type":"file","file":"Schoolvoice/reference/onboarding/After On-Boarding To-Do.md","x":1490,"y":1170,"width":480,"height":180,"color":"1"}
	],
